@{
Page.Title = "About Us";
}

<style type="text/css">

    .about-wrapper {
        background: #fffaf5;
        padding: 40px 20px;
        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    }

    .about-hero {
        background: #5b321f;
        color: white;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 55px 25px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        margin-bottom: 35px;
    }

    .about-hero h1 {
        font-size: 42px;
        margin: 10px 0;
    }

    .about-hero p {
        font-size: 18px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin: 0 auto;
        max-width: 700px;
    }

    .about-content {
        max-width: 1000px;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .about-story {
        background: white;
        padding: 35px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        margin-bottom: 30px;
        box-shadow: 0 3px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    }

    .about-story h2 {
        color: #5b321f;
        font-size: 30px;
        margin-top: 0;
    }

    .about-story p {
        color: #555;
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .about-cards {
        display: table;
        width: 100%;
        table-layout: fixed;
        border-spacing: 20px;
        margin-left: -20px;
    }

    .about-card {
        display: table-cell;
        width: 33.33%;
        background: white;
        padding: 30px 20px;
        text-align: center;
        vertical-align: top;
        border-radius: 10px;
        box-shadow: 0 3px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    }

    .about-card .icon {
        font-size: 45px;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .about-card h3 {
        color: #5b321f;
        font-size: 21px;
        margin: 10px 0;
    }

    .about-card p {
        color: #666;
        line-height: 1.6;
        font-size: 14px;
    }

    .about-stats {
        background: #ead8c8;
        padding: 30px;
        margin: 30px 0;
        border-radius: 10px;
        text-align: center;
    }

    .stat {
        display: inline-block;
        width: 30%;
        vertical-align: top;
    }

    .stat-number {
        display: block;
        color: #5b321f;
        font-size: 32px;
        font-weight: bold;
    }

    .stat-text {
        color: #555;
        font-size: 14px;
    }

    .about-footer {
        background: #5b321f;
        color: white;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 35px 20px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        margin-top: 35px;
    }

    .about-footer h2 {
        margin-top: 0;
        font-size: 28px;
    }

    .about-footer p {
        color: #f4e5d8;
        line-height: 1.6;
    }

    @media screen and (max-width: 700px) {

        .about-hero h1 {
            font-size: 32px;
        }

        .about-cards {
            display: block;
            width: 100%;
            margin-left: 0;
        }

        .about-card {
            display: block;
            width: auto;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .stat {
            display: block;
            width: 100%;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
    }

</style>

<section id="main">

```
<div class="about-wrapper">

    <!-- HERO SECTION -->
    <div class="about-hero">

        <div style="font-size:50px;">☕</div>

        <h1>Our Story</h1>

        <p>
            Great coffee, fresh baked goods and a passion for creating
            memorable experiences.
        </p>

    </div>


    <div class="about-content">

        <!-- STORY -->
        <div class="about-story">

            <h2>From Passion to a Way of Life</h2>

            <p>
                Fourth Coffee was founded in 2010 with a simple idea:
                deliver great coffee and fresh baked goods directly
                to your door.
            </p>

            <p>
                In another life, Bill Baker was a developer by day and
                pastry chef by night. His natural talent with butter,
                flour and sugar soon became more than a hobby.
            </p>

            <p>
                What started as a way to satisfy his own sweet tooth
                became an all-consuming passion. And that passion
                eventually became Fourth Coffee.
            </p>

            <p>
                Today, Fourth Coffee brings together traditional
                baking craftsmanship and modern technology. Our
                online ordering system makes it easy for anyone with
                internet access to order delicious, locally sourced
                coffee, pastries, cookies and cakes.
            </p>

        </div>


        <!-- STATS -->
        <div class="about-stats">

            <div class="stat">

                <span class="stat-number">2010</span>

                <span class="stat-text">
                    Founded
                </span>

            </div>


            <div class="stat">

                <span class="stat-number">24h</span>

                <span class="stat-text">
                    Fresh Delivery
                </span>

            </div>


            <div class="stat">

                <span class="stat-number">100%</span>

                <span class="stat-text">
                    Passion
                </span>

            </div>

        </div>


        <!-- FEATURES -->
        <div class="about-cards">

            <div class="about-card">

                <div class="icon">☕</div>

                <h3>Great Coffee</h3>

                <p>
                    Carefully selected coffee prepared for people
                    who appreciate quality in every cup.
                </p>

            </div>


            <div class="about-card">

                <div class="icon">🥐</div>

                <h3>Freshly Baked</h3>

                <p>
                    Delicious pastries, cookies and cakes made with
                    quality ingredients and lots of passion.
                </p>

            </div>


            <div class="about-card">

                <div class="icon">💻</div>

                <h3>Modern Technology</h3>

                <p>
                    Our simple online ordering system makes getting
                    your favorite treats fast and convenient.
                </p>

            </div>

        </div>


        <!-- FOOTER / CTA -->
        <div class="about-footer">

            <h2>Made With Passion</h2>

            <p>
                From our kitchen to your doorstep,
                every order is made with care.
            </p>

        </div>

    </div>

</div>
```

</section>
